window.products.push({"id":736035,"name":"Aromatherapy Fragrance Test Strips 100pcs Perfume Test Strips Essential Oils Test Tester Paper Strips for Perfume and Essential Oils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jFTH4kckL._SL1139_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material:Paper; Color:White;  Size:Approx 150mm x 7mm(Length x Width)/6inch x 0.28inch Package:100PCS Smelling Ways: 1.Take out 10ml samples into test tube. 2.Put the smelling paper to the place under tube liquid about 6.4cm. 3.Taking out right away and shaking it twice. 4.Exhale,From smelling paper to nose about 1inch,then inhale and smell. 5.Begin the second smelling after 1 minute. 6.Smelling twice every 1 hour.The way same with before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jFTH4kckL._SL1139_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ericotry","source_asin":"B07BFM6C6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFM6C6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFM6C6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
