window.products.push({"id":736127,"name":"Royal Imports Glass Candleholder Flower Vase, Floating & Pillar Candle Centerpiece Display, Decorative Hurricane on Pedestal for Home or Wedding Set o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bG5H78bFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY: This set of 3 Royal Imports glass hurricane candle holders are handcrafted of premium quality clear, flawless glass that do not leak. Each hurricane features evenly rounded walls and beautiful pedestal base to ensure quality and durability. BEST SELLER: These classic clear pedestal vases also referred to as footed floral containers are best sellers in the floral supply, home décor, and wedding planning industry. From home decorators, to event planners, everyone makes use of a good quality, fine glass vase especially when they are value packed as a set of 3. It will accentuate parties, restaurant tables, weddings etc. USES: Pedestal glass candle holders are very popular with fresh flower arrangements as well as silk or dried florals. It is however even more popular for use as a candlestick centerpiece. It is commonly used with votive candles, tea lights, pillar candles and even floating candles when filled with water. TRENDS: Tabletop centerpiece vases are becoming a very hot trend for home, holiday, gifts and events. Fill it with your favorite flower arrangement, succulents, plants or scented candles for your personalized touch. They can even be used empty as a stand-alone table centerpiece or window sill décor. DIMENSIONS & PACKAGING: The set of 3 includes candle holders in 3 different heights. Large- 16”H X 4” W, Medium – 14” H X 4” W, Small – 12” H X 4” W. Each set is carefully wrapped in a custom molded foam to avoid breakage in transit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bG5H78bFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Imports","source_asin":"B08QV3K1JW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QV3K1JW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QV3K1JW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
