window.products.push({"id":736200,"name":"4 Dawn Redwood (Metasequoia glyptostroboides) 1-2'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1IgfiRedJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Latin: Metasequoia glyptostroboides Other common names: Mature Height: 60-80 ft.+ Soil / Climate:Zones 4-8, Native to China. Likes well drained, moist soils. Very rapid grower, best on slightly acidic soils, full sun is needed. It is easily transplanted. Avoid locating the plant in frost pockets since late growth is injured by early fall frosts. Notes: 'Deciduous conifer' that drops its needles in autumn. Fernlike, foliage is medium to bright green. Autumn Foliage turns a unique pinkish tan to reddish bronze before dropping in the fall. Makes a good lawn tree to provide shade, for golf courses, needs space to develop. Wildlife: The Dawn Redwood provides winter cover for birds, small mammals and deer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1IgfiRedJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Metasequoia glyptostroboides","source_asin":"B0088E1GVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0088E1GVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0088E1GVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":736201,"name":"Friendship Ball Twisted Spike Black & White Glass Kugel Ornament by Iron Art Glass Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CVdvPOgPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Twisted Spike Ornament is an elongated 3\" diameter kugel that has been hand pulled and twisted to provide the unique spiral glass effect. Along with striking color combinations the glass has been iridized to provide a reflective characteristic. Because each is completely handmade, the color pattern, twist of the tail, and the length will all be different. The size is 2.5\" diameter x 7\" Long. Twisted Spike Black and White and some shades in between. Hand blown glass with German glass color. Iridized for reflectivity. About Art Glass Decorations: Iron Elegance offers authentic, hand crafted art glass decorations from recycled glass. When making art glass, it is impossible to recreate any piece identically. Our art glass may reveal slight imperfections, possibly air bubbles, tool marks, glass and or color pattern irregularities. These are attributes of skilled handcrafted art glass, rather than a mass produced, machined item and do not imply a defect. Images/Product Descriptions- Iron Elegance does its best to provide accurate product details on Amazon. Displayed digital images have the most accurate representation possible. There may be slight differences in color from the image on screen and color of the product you receive due to the user’s screen settings, photo lighting, surfaces photographed on, time of day the photo was taken, and filters applied. Amazon requires items to be imaged on a bright white background. Glass color can look different from natural light to artificial light. When a sphere is presented as a flat image, the camera sees color from both sides of the sphere. Consumer Safety- Our glass ornaments do not represent a safety risk. However, glassware is fragile. If using it beyond the item’s ornamental intent, breakages can occur and broken glass is an injury hazard. Caution should be taken opening of the product package, handling, hanging, and accessibility to children limited. Ornaments are not intended to be worn, nor rubbed on skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CVdvPOgPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron Elegance","source_asin":"B00GK744OA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GK744OA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GK744OA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
