window.products.push({"id":736266,"name":"Spread The Love Mason Jar Labels, Stickers for Jam, Jelly, Marmalade and Preserves by Once Upon Supplies, 2 Inches Size for Regular Mason Jars, 40 Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hmmSRucoL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"These rustic kraft brown mason jar labels are designed to complement your homemade gifts. Offered in two sizes - the 2\" size labels fit the standard size mason jars and the 2.5\" size labels fit the wide mouth jars. They will stick to both the jar lids & the glass. Printed on lightly textured kraft brown sticker paper with archival quality ink, these labels will add a lovely touch to your homemade gifts. Please note that while these labels are water-resistant, they're not waterproof. They will wrinkle with water contact. This listing is for a pack of 40 2\" round labels with \"spread the love\" text printed on rustic brown kraft sticker paper. The blank lines allow you to write the content of the item you're packaging. Perfect for mason jars, goodie bags, wedding favors & more. About Once Upon Supplies: Once Upon Supplies is a whimsical paper & lifestyle products line for the home. Since 2012, we have been making paper and lifestyle products that are both functional to use and beautiful to look at. Our product lines include labels & stickers, paper goods and gift wrap embellishments. Many of our products have a retro & rustic feel that inspires the do-it-yourself enthusiasts and evokes a sense of playfulness. Everything is designed, printed and packaged with care in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hmmSRucoL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Once Upon Supplies","source_asin":"B018Y12HJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018Y12HJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018Y12HJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":736267,"name":"Satya Nag Champa Ajaro Incense, 20 Sticks x 12 Packs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E1Fi6ktEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Light a Satya Sai Baba product and let your home become transformed into a place of tranquillity and relaxation. Satya Sai Baba products are available in many forms although Nag Champa incense sticks remain the most popular way to enjoy this world famous fragrance. Satya Sai Baba products are generally recognised as the best of all masala incenses. Traditionally it is used in Ashrams which can includes places where yoga is performed, religious ceremonies and musical studies. These products are made in India using pure extracts and the finest scented oils. Let this potent and sweet smelling aroma fill your home and create an atmosphere of relaxation. Using incense sticks is easy, just light the end, wait for it to glow and blow out the flame. Then place it into an incense holder and enjoy the wonderful fragrance that is produced. Set Contains: 12 Packs x 15 gm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E1Fi6ktEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Satya Nagchampa","source_asin":"B00K82PU7I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K82PU7I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K82PU7I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
