window.products.push({"id":736372,"name":"Fountain Pro WT65Lp Submersible Fountain Pump w/ Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7171APD0tML._AC_SL1110_.jpg","description":"FountainPro WT65LP submersible fountain water pump has adjustable flow and is easy to clean. Outlet fittings: 5/16\" ID and 1/2\" ID. Can be used for new fountain/spout, replacement pump for fountain/spout, aquarium applications, ponds and more. Pump dimensions: 1 7/8\"L (48mm) x 1 3/4\"W (44mm) x 1 3/4\"H (42mm) (industry standard total size measurements always include fitting in height measurement.) Maximum head (water lift) 2.1 feet (25\"), flow rate 68GPH. With 10W (watt) halogen tube light. Six feet cord to transformer, 8 feet cord with in-line switch to pump, wire from pump to bulb is 22 inches. Engineered for long life, low energy consumption, adjustable water flow, high lift and extremely quiet operation; suction-cup feet. Removable filter screen and impeller for easy cleaning. Outdoor or indoor use, (switch on cord should be wrapped in plastic if used outdoors for protection from moisture). No stopper on cord, replacement pumps do not come with stoppers. Normal pump life is more than 3 years. One-year manufacturer warranty. Comes with a 3-prong 6-foot corded low voltage power adaptor (input 120V AC, output 12V AC), wall mountable, uses 12 watts. REPLACING A PUMP? BE SURE THE NEW PUMP HAS 1/3 OR MORE WATER LIFT THAN THE HIGHEST POINT MEASUREMENT THE WATER IS TO FLOW OVER. SKIPPING CHECKING THIS MEASUREMENT WILL RESULT IN ORDERING THE WRONG PUMP. PUMP MANUFACTURERS USE THE SAME PUMP MODEL/PART NUMBER FOR ALL VARIATIONS, CUSTOMER MUST CHECK ALL PUMP DETAILS BEFORE BUYING. REPLACEMENT PUMPS ARE ALWAYS THE STOCK VERSION, PUMP VERSIONS WITH VARIATIONS WILL SHARE THE EXACT SAME MODEL NUMBER, DO NOT GO BY THE MODEL NUMBER ONLY WHEN MATCHING A REPLACEMENT PUMP. REAL FOUNTAINS DO NOT USE RUBBER STOPPERS OR RUBBER STOPPERS ON PUMP CORDS, THESE ARE CHAIN STORE FOUNTAINS, PUMP MANUFACTURERS MAKE THESE FOUNTAINS INTENTIONALLY THIS WAY TO CREATE A REPLACEMENT PARTS MONOPOLY, EXACT REPLACEMENT PARTS ARE ONLY AVAILABLE THROUGH THEIR SUPPLY OUTLET.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7171APD0tML._AC_SL1110_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fountain Pro","source_asin":"B006KH1TK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006KH1TK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006KH1TK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
