window.products.push({"id":736499,"name":"L'AGRATY Glow in The Dark Blanket - Grey 50\" x 60\" Soft Star Moon Flannel Blanket for Boys Girls Teens Kids Star Moon Throw Blanket Toys for Kids Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KN+7j1GDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【GLOW BRIGHTER AND LONGER】 - Unlike kids throw blankets which need hours of light and only glow for a while, 95 percent of our glow in the dark blankets for girls and boys can glow longer to 3 hours after placed under bright light source or sunlight for half an hour. Because we use high-quality luminous fiber woven material to absorb and store light energy. The gentle light can also reduce bedtime anxiety to help kids sleep well. Just watch the magic and enjoy an intresting and safe night. 【SOFT AND COZY BLANKET】 - The glowing blanket is made of 280GSM skin-friendly fiber plush flannel, thus you need not worry that the blanket is too thin and will feel soft, comfortable and breathable while sleeping. Also, the breathable fabric is suitbale for boys and girls with sensitive skin. the soft and cozy blanket can be used all year round for boys, girls, teens and kids. 【SIZE AND PATTERNS】 - The 50\" x 60\" kid blanket is large enough for boys and girls. With our cozy glowing kids blankets, kids can do many things freely, such as sleeping, playing, reading and watching TV. At the same time, there are three glowing patterns for you to choose, including colourful unicorns, grey stars and moon and pink stars. All of them are beautiful and suitable for kids of all ages. 【MULTI-FUNCTIONS】 - You can use glowing blankets anywhere, for they are light and easy to carry. The soft blankets for kids can be your warm covers while you are having a rest, watching TV or chatting with others on the bed, counch or sofa, and you can carry them when travelling or camping. What's more, they can be decorations used in bedroom, which must interest girls, boys and kids. 【UNIQUE GIFTS FOR KIDS】 - The glow blanket is a good gift and toy for 1-10 year old girls and boys. It is warm and fun. Its material is soft and warm and its design of glowing is interesting for children. Besides, the glow in the dark blanket can be a guardian of kids at night, which helps them sleep quickly. The kids must be surprised when they receive the unique blanket on Birthday, Christmas, Easter or any occasion. 【EASY CARE】 - The glow in the dark blanket is washable and dryable. You can wash it with machine and the blanket will be dried quickiy even at low temperature. However, please do not put it in extrme hot water and wash it alone. The kids throw blanket is wrinkle and fade resistant, never sheds and affects the luminous performance. 【PLEASANT SHOPPING EXPERIENCE】- We love our customers and always take best products and services as our priority. If for any reason you are not satisfied with your purchase, we will refund the full amount-no questions asked! We can answer your questions and are always happy to hear from you within 24 hours. So please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KN+7j1GDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'AGRATY","source_asin":"B0B5XR3JS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5XR3JS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5XR3JS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
