window.products.push({"id":736538,"name":"Tbcoou Pink Velvet Curtains 72 Inches Length Luxury Velvet Curtain Drapes for Bedroom Living Room Darkening Thermal Insulated Energy Efficient Window ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gIHirodNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Velvet Curtain Panels: Each luxury velvet curtain set comes in 2 panels, each window curtain panel measures 52 inches width (104\"W for pair). Our solid velvet curtains feature a grommet design with 1.6 inch silver rings to coordinate with most curtain rods. These blackout window curtains are easy to install and maintain, dress up your living room window for the holiday season with TBCOOU ready-made super soft velvet curtains. Room Darkening Curtains: Not total blackout but heavy enough to block light. TBCOOU velvet drapery provides a simple way to create a comfortable, dark sleep environment and better TV viewing. Also, it provides absolute privacy and decrease a few outside noises, these luxurious velvet curtains frame your views in pure luxury. Energy Efficient Curtain: Add warmth and a cozy feel for your room. These insulation curtains can repel the summer heat & winter cold, which can lower your heating & cooling cost. Visit our store and discover more window treatments in a variety of designs and fabrics, let us discovering delights in life together. Versatile Soft Velvet Curtain: Not only are these curtains cute for the living room area, but also a perfect addition to your glass door, sliding door, laundry room, study, bedroom, dining room, nursery, kitchen and doorway. These room darkening curtains can go with European, modern or vintage style home decor as you like. Be creative with our velvet curtain panels. Easy Care Bedroom Curtains: These velvet curtain sets are made to last. The curtain panels are durable on the window thanks to the sturdy velvet fabric and top-notch sewing quality. Black out curtains are machine washable in cold water and tumble dry in low setting. Do not bleach. Creases on the velvet curtain from packing and shipping can be pressed by ironing or steaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gIHirodNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tbcoou","source_asin":"B09GB7W9KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GB7W9KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GB7W9KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
