window.products.push({"id":736574,"name":"Ferrino Line Blue on Black Diamond Patterned Gaming and Lifestyle Chair by RapidX","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZFSd9E7L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Somewhere along the line, racing seats got something right that office chairs missed. Believing the attractive aesthetic, the supportive polyurethane foam core, or the freedom to fully recline, the team at RapidX incorporated all three features—and many more—into their Ferrino line of gaming and lifestyle chairs. From the Manufacturer Designed for Style and Comfort The Ferrino’s powernap-friendly backrest reclines to 155 degrees—further than the vast majority of office and lifestyle chairs on the market. When you need to rest, put on your eyeshades or your virtual reality headset and have a revitalizing rest in the most convenient location imaginable: your current one. Simply slip off the lumbar support pillow, use the car seat style lever to recline to your desired angle, and recharge. Fully Adjustable Designed for style and comfort, complete with removable lumbar and neck support pillows, a five-point caster wheel base, multi-directional adjustable armrests, and distinctive diamond-patterned stitching, the Ferrino gaming and lifestyle chair will support you and your sense of style whether you’re writing business reports, gaming, using it as a mechanic shop seat, or watching sports. Ergonomics meets Design The RapidX Ferrino gaming and lifestyle chair combines sound ergonomics with striking qualities from racing culture. The result: a sporty, custom-colored office chair with the vibe of a Ferrari revving its engine on the starting line of the Formula One World Championship Race. Durable and Stylized Inspired by professional harness bucket seats, the RapidX Ferrino features an attractive, customized exterior that conceals its orthopedically and ergonomically designed core. Designed for Work and Play With its alluring high-contrast color options, diamond-patterned stitching and five-point caster wheelbase, this office and lifestyle chair will support your back and your flair for style whether you’re at work, at play, or engaged in one of your hobbies. It’s time to sit down and stand out. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Design. Adjustability. Comfort. How did you come up with the idea for this product? Having owned a lifestyle furniture company in the past, as well operating a gaming company for 20+ years paved the way for my next endeavor. The actual idea for RapidX was born when my office chair broke. Right then, I realized that I wanted to create something that expressed a perfect blend of lifestyle, technology, and quality. I took an actual car seat out of an old favorite car and fitted it to a chair base. Not only was it comfortable, but also received many compliments on its unique style. Friends and family started asking me to build identical chairs for them. What makes your product special? RapidX made a conscious decision to rise above the norm of chair manufacturing. This is based on prioritizing cost-effectiveness with a more mindful approach to materials and design standards. Unlike the costly and unattractive ergonomically designed chairs, RapidX’s chair lines not only looks amazing, but also inspires your playful inner child. What has been the best part of your startup experience? The best part of the startup experience is witnessing the transformation from the concept stage to the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZFSd9E7L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RapidX","source_asin":"B073XMCDT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XMCDT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XMCDT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
