window.products.push({"id":736644,"name":"Ozeri Maestro Electric Wine Opener in Stainless-Steel, with Infrared Wine Thermometer and Digital LCD","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gS81BpEZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by the wine cellar tradition of monitoring wine temperature with precision to ensure the best flavors and aromas, the Ozeri Maestro Electric Wine Opener in Stainless-Steel blends an advanced electric wine opener with a new state of the art infrared non contact thermometer. The Ozeri Maestro Electric Wine Opener opens up to 80 bottles of wine on a single charge, and its built-in thermometer displays both wine bottle and room temperature readings on its digital LCD screen. As oenophiles know, temperature is one of the major determinants of wine flavor and balance. Unfavorable temperatures can cause an increase in tannins, excess acidity, aroma decay, premature aging, reduced potency and other undesirable characteristics. With the Ozeri Maestro Electric Wine Opener, your wine will always be served at the right temperature. The Maestro also features a digital battery meter on its LCD screen so that you are never out of charge. The Stainless-Steel Maestro Electric Wine Opener makes opening wine bottles easy, exciting and entertaining. Designed for home and restaurant use, it operates without cords via the simple push of a button. The Maestro includes an elegant recharging base with a built in foil cutter to remove wine seals. The Ozeri Maestro Electric Wine Opener opens both natural and synthetic corks, and features an ergonomic grip for easy handling. With its latest generation technology, modern design, and superior stainless-steel workmanship, the Ozeri Maestro Electric Wine Opener is the perfect gift and ultimate accessory to every kitchen and wine bar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gS81BpEZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozeri","source_asin":"B09C8V5P9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C8V5P9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C8V5P9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":736645,"name":"Orii Gourmet Zano 12\" Vinegar Bottle Infused with Red Chili, Yellow Chili, Green Chili, Rosemary, String Bean, Orangre Slice, Garlic and Vinegar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JVclNb86L._AC_.jpg","description":"Inspire yourself with vivid, organic culinary art-the Orii Gourmet Decorative Vinegar Bottle Collection. A homage to the rich cuisine and legendary romance of the Mediterranean region, our program features bottle designs inspired by everything from old world flasks to abstract geometric shapes. Each glass bottle is carefully laced with intricate layers of color and texture-rich peppers. herbs, citrus and vinegar. They'll brighten any decor from rustic old world to cutting edge modern with vivacious hues of natural origin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JVclNb86L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orii Gourmet","source_asin":"B00874O3JA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00874O3JA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00874O3JA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
