window.products.push({"id":736686,"name":"ADBZEN Moka Pot Stovetop Espresso Maker Classic Italian Style Coffee Maker Pot Natural Wood Handle (3 Cups)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610RFVTiegL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADBZEN: American Local Company.Better Quality,Better Service! Adbzen Moka Pot Features: Adbzen's Unique Bottom Design can be used on a variety of stovetops, gas, or ceramic, induction, electric, halogen cooktops. Solid wooden beech handle, more heat-resistant and beautiful. Adbzen Moka Pot is made from a premium food-grade lightweight material. Enjoy a cup of moka espresso coffee at any time. Specification： Material: Food-grade Aluminum, Wood Color: Black 3Cups Size:4x5.7x3.3 inch 5fl 6Cups Size:4.6x7.1x3.7 inch 9.3 fl Package includes: 1 x Adbzen Moka Pot Usage Introduction： 1.Fill the bottom chamber with water until the bottom of the relief valve. 2.Fill the funnel with finely ground coffee (do not compact or compress). 3.Assemble parts and place on stovetop over low heat (gas, ceramic, induction, electric, or halogen cooktops). 4.The Moka pot has a purring sound when the coffee is brewed. When it stops purring, turn off the flame. Your Italian-style Moka coffee is ready! Attentions： 1.When the coffee is brewed, do not touch the body of the Moka pot with your hands, please hold the wooden handle (real wood has a good thermal insulation effect) to lift the Moka pot and pour out the coffee. 2.Silicone:Thermal stability (constancy of properties over a wide temperature range of −100 to 250 °C)----by wikipedia.org Warm tip: Don't keep the moka pot on the fire all the time!The silicone is non-toxic and harmless. Our silicone gasket products have passed various safety tests and proved safe. So Please rest assured to use it! You can verify with a simple test that there is no unpleasant smell when burning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610RFVTiegL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ADBZEN","source_asin":"B09VHCH6T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VHCH6T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VHCH6T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":736687,"name":"Oaken-Cat Down Alternative Comforter Duvet Queen - Ultra-Soft 3D-Air Breathable Fabric, All Season 3-Piece Cloud Plush Diamond Shape Quilted Microfibe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W815TXARL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester 💤 YEAR-AROUND COMFORT - The QUEEN size comforter is 90x90 inches, 270 gsm (~45oz) fill weight, all seasons microfiber comforter. Filled just right amount of a luxurious plush, down-like and bio-based microfiber filling, our all season down alternative comforter set is truly fluffy, ultra-soft, lightweight, breathable, cozy- everything you need for your all years dreamy night’s sleep. 💤 ULTRA-SOFT AND COZY - Crafted from extremely soft 120gsm microfiber polyester fabric, Reversible design: one side is 3D-air bubble embossing for extra breathable, and one side is light brushed & pre-washed for extra softness. 💤 SLEEP IN CLOUD - Our down alternative comforter use a sustainable ClimaLoft microfiber, which is earth-friendly derived from renewable sources, can helps to create an air layer for better circulation and allows the microfill absorb moisture and sweat quickly, cleverly regulate your temperature to keep you cool, dry and warm - whatever the weather. It provide a subtle cosy sleep zone and keep you in deep sleep more time. 💤 INTIMATE DESIGN - Feature a diamond box stitch to contain the fill and prevent shifting or bunching--never any clumping or cool spots. Quilted with the elegant premium 8mm Piped Edges, it not only looks beautiful but also ensures strength and durability. 4 corner loops anchor duvet cover tight to minimize shifting for utmost comfort. The easy-care microfiber is machine washable and dryable. 💤 EASY USE - Noise-Free and more Breathable, NO Tearing or Horrible Odor. Compliant to GRS and OEKO-Tex Standard 100. Come with brand new package, please air and spread it at first time use. Use it as a stand-alone comforter or comforter insert with your favorite duvet cover. 100-days return and replacement guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W815TXARL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oaken-Cat","source_asin":"B0871GCFKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0871GCFKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0871GCFKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
