window.products.push({"id":736753,"name":"Churchill China Country Crafts Sandstone (Oatmeal) Square 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V1K9Y29QL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Country Crafts Square Sandstone dinnerware radiates a rustic romance that unlocks the secret of rural living. This Sandstone soft cream oatmeal colourway is enhanced by the antiqued edges & Fleur De Lis crests which evoke a natural lifestyle. This vintage feel is applied to the Set of four 11.25inch Dinner Plates, perfect for either Casual or Formal dining. Manufactured in fine natural, durable stoneware, Country Craft products are both Microwave & Dishwasher safe. This collection is endorsed by Churchill China with its 200 years of history in the manufacture of dinnerware for the home. Amazon.com Romantically rustic, Churchill Country Crafts Square dinnerware brings easy refinement to a renovated farmhouse, uptown loft, or any home looking for a bit of country chic. The collection features generously crafted shapes and a high-gloss glaze, enhanced by Fleur De Lis crests and antiqued edges that make each piece feel like it's been part of the family for generations. Start your collection or stock up for larger dining occasions with this 16-piece dinnerware set. Included are four place settings, each with an 11-1/4-inch dinner plate, 8-inch salad plate, 20-ounce footed soup/cereal bowl, and 14-ounce mug. The set's square shapes, softened by gently curved edges, provide an elegant and refreshing setting for a traditional table and coordinate with both the Country Crafts Square and Country Crafts Round patterns. Made of fine stoneware with a Pantine Green or Sandstone glaze, this dinnerware is naturally durable and can safely be placed in the microwave and dishwasher. --Kara Karll What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 11-1/4-inch dinner plate; 8-inch salad plate; 20-ounce soup/cereal bowl; 14-ounce mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V1K9Y29QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Churchill China","source_asin":"B0002EXFEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002EXFEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002EXFEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":736754,"name":"Custom Photo Coffee Mugs Personalized Picture Coffee Gift 11 Oz Mug for Couples and Families","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zWQeOxm1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Perfectly define your FRIENDSHIP】Choose from 180+ Hairstyle & 3 Skin colors and personalize with your friend's name, up to 5 persons（WOMEN OR MAN） & 5 Scenes. You can customize the message in back side. Each cup is customized by you featuring your friend to maximize cuteness, personality and functionality. 【CREAT YOUR OWN BEST FRIEND MUG】1. Choose the scenery - Number of friends - Click on \"Customize Now\"=>2. Browse Hairstyle and Skin color 3. Full in the friend's name, skin color and hairstyle number in the input box 4. Choose message in back side. Finish all the required options step by step then one of our award winning artist will turn it into a custom masterpiece! 【Preservation of Memory】Our patented state-of-the-art printing process makes the adorable prints of your loved ones resistant to fades, peels and scratches. High grade ceramic with large handles to ensure safe storage and use. Microwave & dishwasher safe. Capacity: 11OZ. 【Perfect Gift Idea】Personalized gifts for a great best friend, sister, brother, bridesmaid boyfriend, girlfriend to celebrate your eternal bond of friendship! It's awesome to watch friends you love unwrap a thoughtful gift. The Funny custom gifts range can be turned into unique goodies for all ages. Personalized mug allow you to preserve memories for life. 【100% Satisfaction Guarantee】We offer the highest quality custom handmade artwork. Our customer service team will do whatever it takes to help you with any issues that arrive, or questions you might have. Service until you are satisfied.(Please double check your personalized info before submit)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zWQeOxm1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEELU","source_asin":"B0814RBBP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0814RBBP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0814RBBP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":736755,"name":"Coiwin Ceramic knives with Sheaths Super Sharp and Rust Proof and Stain Resistant (6\" Bread Knife, 6\" Chef Knife, 5\" Utility Knife, 4\" Fruit Knife), B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zHF+yEbuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ceramic kitchen knife set comes with four different knives. First, we’ve included a six-inch bread knife with a French-style point. This knife has a serrated edge that is specifically designed to cut soft bread without crushing it. Second, we’ve included a six-inch chef’s knife with a smooth edge and a triangular point. This large knife is suitable for a variety of uses in the kitchen, like slicing boneless meat, vegetables, and fruit. Third, we’ve included a five-inch utility knife with a smooth edge and a triangular point. This knife is also suitable for a variety of slicing needs. Fourth, we’ve included a four-inch fruit knife with a smooth edge and a triangular point. This small knife is suitable for cutting and paring fruits or small vegetables. All four of these knives have ceramic blades made from zirconia. Ceramic knives are superior to stainless steel knives in that they are significantly harder. In fact, zirconia is second in hardness only to diamond. Because of this hardness, ceramic knives are very sharp and able to retain their sharp cutting edge up to ten times longer than metal knives. That means you won’t need to regularly sharpen these knives as you would metal knives. Because they are very sharp, we’ve included four sheaths that cover the blades and prevent accidents. These black ceramic knives have non-reactive blades that are resistant to oils and acids. Thus, unlike other knives, these knives will not change the original taste, smell, or color of the food you are cutting. Additionally, these knives are rustproof and stain resistant, and they won’t absorb any food elements. This makes them extremely easy to clean—all they need is a quick rinse. Do not use a dishwasher to clean the knives, as they can chip. We also recommend using only silicone, wooden, plastic, or bamboo cutting boards. Do not use these knives for carving, chopping, boning, or prying. Our products have a 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zHF+yEbuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coiwin","source_asin":"B06W9JF7PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W9JF7PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W9JF7PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
