window.products.push({"id":736810,"name":"Vicks NaturalCare Cool Mist Ultrasonic Humidifier (VUL530), White, Small Room – Humidifier and Diffuser with Nighttime Light, Works with Vicks VapoPad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XV73KYI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Provide natural support for your wellbeing and create your ideal sanctuary with Vicks NaturalCare Cool Mist Ultrasonic Humidifier. It’s a cool mist humidifier with essential oil diffuser, plus it accepts Vicks VapoPads and has calming color changing lights to create a peaceful, restorative environment. Designed for year round use to support your wellness - winter cough and cold season, spring pollen relief, or just for relaxing with naturally comforting cool mist.    Humidifiers for home can be helpful during cold season, when it’s difficult for children to sleep with cough/congestion. For calming aromatherapy, add a few drops of your favorite essential oils to the water and turn the powerful humidifier into an essential oil diffuser (oils not included). You can also use Vicks VapoPads and enjoy the comforting, nostalgic scent of Vicks. To complete your oasis, simply turn on the color-changing light and soothe yourself with the peaceful glow. Delivering multiple solutions in one, NaturalCare makes it simple to support your wellness year-round, naturally. This Vicks humidifier is ideal for small rooms and is quick and easy to use and clean. The wide tank opening offers easy filling and cleaning. You can enjoy visible cool mist for up to 24 hours on the lowest setting, or utilize the auto shut-off. It’s quiet, and customizable color changing lights with an optional nighttime feature make it a great choice for your bedroom or as a baby humidifier for nursery or kids rooms. Holds up to 2 Vicks VapoPads for additional soothing comfort (one sample included). At Vicks, we believe that everyone deserves a touch of care. Vicks is the #1 brand recommended by Pediatricians.* Our line of humidifiers, steam inhalers and vaporizers help you breathe better and sleep more comfortably, wherever you are. *Based on a March 2020 survey of Pediatricians conducted by Arendt Consulting, of those Pediatricians who recommend humidifiers, Vicks brand humidifiers are the most often recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XV73KYI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicks","source_asin":"B097Q9NPX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-736810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097Q9NPX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097Q9NPX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
